# Owner map for this repository.
#
# `main` is protected with require_code_owner_reviews, so these entries are
# binding: a pull request touching a listed path needs a review from its owner.
# The maintainer is exempt through enforce_admins: false, which exists because
# GitHub does not allow approving your own pull request and there is only one
# account with push access. The production trust boundary is the private
# `Franiboy/dnd_dashboard-deploy` repository; everything that can deploy,
# promote or review is owned from there.
